              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela naakasika ku-Lehi, ba-Filisti bakeza buongolola kuzoomucinga. Mpawo Muuya wa-Jehova wakamuselukila canguzu, elyo intambo nzyakajisi amaboko aakwe akaba mbuli tutambo buyo tutentedwe mumulilo, azyaanzyo zyakwe zyakeenzunuka amaanza aakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
