        {
          "text": "Lino wakajana mweebo mupiya wambongolo, nkabela wakatandabika ijanza lyakwe, wakaubweza, wakaujazya bantu bali cuulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.15",
